1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,460
Mia has seven apples.

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,610
She gives three
apples to her friend.

3
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,539
How many apples
does Mia have left?

4
00:00:06,349 --> 00:00:07,619
Let's count Mia's apples.

5
00:00:07,899 --> 00:00:10,146
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven.

6
00:00:10,927 --> 00:00:12,677
Now Mia gives three apples away.

7
00:00:12,937 --> 00:00:13,824
One, two, three.

8
00:00:14,603 --> 00:00:16,073
Look at the apples that stay.

9
00:00:16,183 --> 00:00:17,433
One, two, three, four.

10
00:00:18,195 --> 00:00:19,795
Seven take away three is four.

11
00:00:20,045 --> 00:00:21,575
Mia has four apples left.

12
00:00:21,885 --> 00:00:22,580
Great job!
